# /now external sources. All build-time only; missing or failing sources
# degrade silently (the page still renders). Set the populated ones in Vercel
# project settings → Environment Variables for the live site.

# Letterboxd — public RSS, no key needed. Just your username.
# https://letterboxd.com/<your-username>/
LETTERBOXD_USER=

# GitHub — public events API. Username only; the token is optional and only
# raises the rate limit (60/h unauth → 5000/h auth). Use a fine-grained PAT
# with no scopes (read-only public).
GITHUB_USER=
GITHUB_TOKEN=

# Last.fm — username + free API key from https://www.last.fm/api/account/create
LASTFM_USER=
LASTFM_KEY=
